<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds end lower, await 5-yr auction.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds end lower, await 5-yr auction.</headline>
<text>
<p>1640 GMT - Portuguese bonds ended lower with French election still weighing.Attention to focus on 5-yr bond auction tomorrow.</p>
<p>*June 97 futures down 0.40 points at 108.75</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 101.10 vs 101.40, yield 6.46 pct vs 6.42 pct</p>
<p>*Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -17 bps vs -14 bps</p>
</text>
